    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサーさん、お帰りなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……どうでしたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "――おめでとう、智代子！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』出場決定だ！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ほ、本当ですか！　本当ですよね！？\r\nやったぁあ！　嬉しい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こ、これ……\r\n夢じゃないんですよね……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。夢なんかじゃないぞ\r\n正真正銘、智代子が掴み取った結果だ！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……はい！\r\n私、ついにここまで来れたんですね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、よく頑張ったな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい……はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……でも、私が頑張れたのは\r\nファンのみんなとプロデューサーさんのおかげです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "今の私でいいんだって、みんなが教えてくれたから！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n智代子は、ファンの期待にしっかり応えたんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私を応援してくれた人たちのためにも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001070120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そして、私を支えてくれたプロデューサーさんのためにも、\r\n優勝したいです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000107/7010001070120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あぁ、絶対に優勝しよう！",
